    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mullery O’Gara are pleased to present 54 Crannagh Road, Rathfarnham, Dublin 14 to the market. \r\n\r\nA substantial bay-windowed semi-detached family home c. 2691 sq. ft. / 250 sq. m. \r\n\r\nUpgraded and extended over recent years with wonderfully proportioned living space, full of natural light and set in secluded well-stocked gardens with ample parking to front and south facing to rear. \r\n\r\nBacking onto the Castle Golf Club grounds to rear and situated within minutes of Rathfarnham and Terenure villages with their wide selection of shops, restaurants, and cafés. Beside schools, bus routes, Bushy Park, and convenient to Dundrum Town Centre, city centre, and M50. \r\n\r\nComprising hall with W.C., WHB off, two inter-connecting reception rooms with bay window, mantlepieces and door to garden. There is a family room and open plan kitchen/breakfast with Newcastle Design kitchen and utility off. Upstairs bedroom 1 (side) and showerroom. Bathroom, 4 further bedrooms at this level and attic bedroom with showerroom. Outside are large well-stocked grounds with parking to front, south-facing to rear, covered side access."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall  \r\nStained glass door. Tiled floor, cloakroom, understairs storage, panelled ceiling. \r\n\r\nLounge \r\nMarble mantlepiece with tiled insert, slate hearth, bay window, picture rail, sliding doors to \r\n\r\nLiving room \r\nOrnate pine-painted mantlepiece with slate insert and hearth. Picture rail, bay with glazed doors and windows to garden. \r\n\r\nInner hall \r\nW.C., WHB. Tiled. \r\n\r\nFamily room \r\nCeiling coving, recessed lights, wood flooring. \r\n\r\nBreakfastroom/ \r\nSolid fuel stove \r\n\r\nKitchen \r\nExtensive range of Newcastle Kitchen units with granite worktop. Sink unit, plumbed for dishwasher. Ceiling coving, recessed lights, 4x Velux windows, tiled floor. Sliding patio doors to rear. \r\n\r\nUtility \r\nSink unit, fitted units. Plumbed for washing machine, water cylinder, tiled floor, door to side. \r\n\r\nUpstairs \r\nBedroom 1 (side) \r\nSliderobes. Ceiling coving, shower, W.C., WHB with medicine cupboard. Tiled. \r\n\r\nBathroom \r\nBath with shower attachment, W.C., WHB, twin shower. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (rear) \r\nStained timber floor shelving. \r\n\r\nBedroom 3 (rear) \r\nWall to wall fitted wardrobe with glazed doors. \r\n\r\nBedroom 4 (front) \r\nFitted wardrobe, bay window, picture rail, shelving. \r\n\r\nBedroom 5 (front) \r\nFitted wardrobe. \r\n\r\nLanding \r\nCupboard. \r\n\r\nStairs to \r\n\r\nAttic bedroom \r\nShower, W.C., WHB, Velux window, towel radiator, tiled eaves storage. \r\n\r\nOutside \r\nGravelled and cobbled parking to front. \r\nSouth-facing rear garden in lawn, bordered by a variety of shrubs. Patio areas, timber framed outhouse with storage and seating area. Covered side access. C.H. boiler."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
